## CI en apps (ej. Costify)

```yaml
- uses: PalmApps/palmapps-notify@v2
  with:
    telegram_bot_token: ${{ secrets.TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN }}
    telegram_forum_chat_id: ${{ secrets.TELEGRAM_FORUM_CHAT_ID }}
    app: costify
    version: ${{ steps.meta.outputs.version }}
    template: android-release
```

Tag nuevo en action → semver (`v3`, …) y push del tag.

## Convenciones agente

- No commitear `.env.local` ni tokens.
- Textos Telegram → plantillas UTF-8; ver rule `utf8-telegram.mdc`.
- Nueva app: `apps.json` + `templates/history/{app}.json` + topic en foro + workflow con `app:` key.
- Costify APK: tag `v*.*.*` → `Costify/.github/workflows/android-release.yml`.

